<title>USA: Strouds August same store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Strouds August same store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc Thursday said sales for the four-week period ended August 31 rose to $15.6 million from $13.5 million for the same period last year, but same store sales fell 4.2 percent.</p>
<p>Net sales for the 26 weeks ended August 31 were $95.9 million compared with $85.9 million for the same period last year. Year-to-date same store sales rose 2.0 percent.</p>
